<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:41:15 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>210亿美元基金青睐非洲本地债券，加大对乌干达的押注</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/fund-with-21-billion-favors-africa-local-bonds-adds-to-uganda-bet</link><description>上个月乌干达先令汇率暴跌 8%，令一些投资者感到不安，但未能阻止资产规模达 210 亿美元的基金经理的脚步。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/fund-with-21-billion-favors-africa-local-bonds-adds-to-uganda-bet'&gt;210亿美元基金青睐非洲本地债券，加大对乌干达的押注&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Fund With $21 Billion Favors Africa Local Bonds, Adds to Uganda Bet&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/fund-with-21-billion-favors-africa-local-bonds-adds-to-uganda-bet</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:26:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巴西雷亚尔因卢拉支持进一步限制支出的报道而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</link><description>有报道称，巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦支持采取进一步措施遏制政府支出，缓解了人们对赤字的担忧，上个月他意外连任后，赤字拖累巴西货币大幅贬值，巴西雷亚尔创下近两个月来最大涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs'&gt;巴西雷亚尔因卢拉支持进一步限制支出的报道而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Real Rallies on Reports Lula Backs Further Spending Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:12:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>阿拉比卡咖啡价格下跌，交易所库存激增 28 年来最大</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/arabica-drops-as-exchange-stockpiles-surge-most-in-28-years</link><description>由于交易所监控的仓库供应量出现自 1998 年以来的最大单日涨幅，咖啡期货下跌，这为历史上紧张的市场带来了一些缓解。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/arabica-drops-as-exchange-stockpiles-surge-most-in-28-years'&gt;阿拉比卡咖啡价格下跌，交易所库存激增 28 年来最大&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Arabica Drops as Exchange Stockpiles Surge Most in 28 Years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/arabica-drops-as-exchange-stockpiles-surge-most-in-28-years</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:54:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纽约市呼吁 Kalshi 和 Polymarket 就针对青少年的营销活动作证</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</link><description>纽约市立法者呼吁来自最大预测市场的高管作证，市议会正在调查这些平台是否使用欺骗性营销策略来吸引据称以不成比例的速度亏损的年轻用户。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth'&gt;纽约市呼吁 Kalshi 和 Polymarket 就针对青少年的营销活动作证&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：NYC Calls on Kalshi, Polymarket to Testify on Marketing to Youth&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:21:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标普 500 指数波动撕毁剧本，市场择时者接受教育</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks</link><description>避免股市下跌通常意味着错过最大的收益。那些在上周美国股市暴跌后套现的人刚刚吸取了惨痛的教训。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks'&gt;标普 500 指数波动撕毁剧本，市场择时者接受教育&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Market Timers Get Schooled as S&amp;P 500 Swings Rip Up Playbooks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:41:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>New Balance 让“老爹鞋”成为 Z 世代的时尚单品</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/new-balance-turns-dad-shoe-into-trendy-hit-with-gen-z-video</link><description>New Balance 今年已经 120 岁了，并且没有任何放缓的迹象。这家总部位于波士顿的鞋类和时装公司正在努力实现一些雄心勃勃的销售目标。彭博社的 Romaine Bostick 于 10 月 29 日在纽约与 New Balance 总裁兼首席执行官 Joe Preston 和绩效副总裁 Kevin FitzPatrick 进行了交谈。（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/new-balance-turns-dad-shoe-into-trendy-hit-with-gen-z-video'&gt;New Balance 让“老爹鞋”成为 Z 世代的时尚单品&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New Balance Turns 'Dad Shoe' Into Trendy Hit With Gen Z&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/new-balance-turns-dad-shoe-into-trendy-hit-with-gen-z-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:28:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>LME收紧大头寸规则以解决铝挤压问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze</link><description>伦敦金属交易所采取行动解决扰乱铝市场的大规模挤压问题，瞄准了持有大量头寸的交易商。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze'&gt;LME收紧大头寸规则以解决铝挤压问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：LME Tightens Rules on Big Positions to Address Aluminum Squeeze&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/lme-tightens-rules-on-big-positions-to-address-aluminum-squeeze</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:28:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>步行俱乐部是健身文化的解药</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/walking-clubs-are-the-antidote-to-fitness-culture-video</link><description>跑步已经过时，步行正在流行。年轻人正在放弃剧烈的有氧运动，转而采用较慢的锻炼方式。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/walking-clubs-are-the-antidote-to-fitness-culture-video'&gt;步行俱乐部是健身文化的解药&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Walking Clubs Are the Antidote to Fitness Culture&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/walking-clubs-are-the-antidote-to-fitness-culture-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:28:29 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>